/**
 * LIVE — flagship "Combined" game-landing design, Wave 7 rollout.
 *
 * CONTENT FIX, not just a design swap: this route's family is "ark" (ARK:
 * Survival EVOLVED, the original 2015 game, Steam app 376030), but the
 * previous version of this page had its entire copy — title, hero, FAQ,
 * steps — swapped with ARK: Survival ASCENDED content (Studio Wildcard's
 * separate UE5 remake, family "arkasa", its own page at
 * /ark-survival-ascended-server-hosting). That was a leftover copy-paste bug,
 * confirmed by the comment at the top of ark-survival-ascended-server-hosting
 * /page.tsx ("the original ARK: Survival Evolved, which stays live at
 * /ark-server-hosting"). This rewrite is genuinely about Survival Evolved.
 *
 * This also converts the page from self-managed VPS framing (customer SSHes
 * in and runs SteamCMD themselves) to the real one-click managed hosting
 * that just went live (prisma/seed-wave7-games.ts — real OsTemplate +
 * GamePlan rows, confirmed orderable in the deploy wizard).
 *
 * PREVIEW_GAMES.ark was authored directly from those real seeded GamePlan
 * rows (8 GB/20 slots $14.99, 16 GB/50 slots $27.99 popular, 32 GB/100 slots
 * $49.99) — no price override needed here.
 *
 * Art: family "ark"'s art slug is "ark-asa" (see lib/games.ts GAME_ART_SLUG).
 * Confirmed via that file's own comment that "ark-asa" actually contains
 * genuine ARK: Survival EVOLVED key art despite the confusing slug name (a
 * separate, already-documented mislabeling issue) — so the art is correct
 * for this family and no art change was made alongside this copy fix.
 *
 * FAQ + related-links sections below follow the same pattern as
 * rust-server-hosting/page.tsx, since GameLandingCombined doesn't render its
 * own FAQ/related sections.
 */

